WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,680 --> 00:00:02,880
The inventory is done

2
00:00:02,880 --> 00:00:05,480
Food and water are consumed at the current rate

3
00:00:05,480 --> 00:00:07,580
If you save some money, it can probably last about twenty days.

4
00:00:07,580 --> 00:00:10,380
But there aren't many left of the mother sword.

5
00:00:10,380 --> 00:00:12,480
Less than twenty of them consume a lot of gasoline.

6
00:00:12,480 --> 00:00:13,380
I know

7
00:00:13,380 --> 00:00:14,780
Tonight, Wei An and I will work together

8
00:00:14,780 --> 00:00:16,180
Rotate after two hours

9
00:00:16,180 --> 00:00:18,380
Others take the time to rest

10
00:00:18,380 --> 00:00:23,030
They are all waiting for me to make up my mind

11
00:00:23,030 --> 00:00:24,430
But I'm not God

12
00:00:24,430 --> 00:00:25,830
It is a very useful knife

13
00:00:25,830 --> 00:00:26,930
But you have to hold the handle tightly

14
00:00:26,930 --> 00:00:28,030
Xiaolin is emotionally unstable

15
00:00:28,030 --> 00:00:30,430
Zhou Shaocheng, his wife and Lin Hao couldn't afford the room.

16
00:00:30,430 --> 00:00:31,730
A bunch of loose sand

17
00:00:31,730 --> 00:00:33,230
But the poisonous wolf doesn't live long

18
00:00:33,430 --> 00:00:35,330
I have to make them a team

19
00:00:35,330 --> 00:00:50,230
Don't move anything

20
00:00:50,230 --> 00:01:01,320
After smashing it for a long time, there was no movement inside.

21
00:01:01,320 --> 00:01:02,620
Is there really no one?

22
00:01:02,620 --> 00:01:04,220
Or they all slept to death
